"body": "# Reports and output\n\n## Generated reports\n\n| Report | Contents |\n|---|---|\n| Cover sheet and table of contents | Project details and every page with its latest revision |\n| Panel schedules | Breakers by slot with load and voltage drop |\n| Bill of materials | Parts grouped by part number with prices |\n| Terminal diagrams and connection list | Terminals and every connection |\n| Cable overview and diagrams | Cables and their conductors |\n| Tubing list | Tubes grouped by outside diameter |\n| Door and window schedule | Every door and window on the floor plans |\n| Framing reports | Lumber lists, cut lists, cutting plans and building views |\n| Deck hardware lists | Hangers, brackets, fasteners and concrete per deck |\n| Tile reports | Tile cut lists and tile orders |\n| Revision overview | Revisions and the pages changed in each |\n\n- Project properties turn each report on or off and set the order of the reports and of the page tree sections.\n\n## Custom reports\n\n- A custom report is an editable copy of a report, with filters, hidden and renamed columns, extra rows and notes.\n\n## Parts\n\n- Part numbers are the manufacturer code and the order number, for example PXC.3031212.\n- The manufacturer list is shared by everyone on the server.\n\n## Export and import\n\n| Format | Use |\n|---|---|\n| PDF | Vector pages with bookmarks and clickable cross-references |\n| Excel | Bill of materials, framing materials, tile layouts; Excel import updates devices by ID |\n| CSV | Bill of materials, panel schedule, terminals; parts import |\n| DXF, SVG, PNG | Floor plan levels and pages |\n"
